        "true": [
          {
            "id": "195f5ba4-57e0-488d-a2b7-d53087438f58",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "60070bec-a45a-4719-ac95-10f65a30c09b",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "42347c4f-216f-488b-a5c8-ab67b008c52a",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Clerk: STEADY\nmeans message\nreceived. DOUBLE\nmeans send the\ncourier.",
                      "DARK means no\nconfirmed signal,\nso check in\nperson. No rapid",
                      "flashing, and no\ncolor test. We use\na plain written\ncard at every",
                      "post as well as\nthe lamp."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "79c81883-7238-4f4b-ab24-df3e448d05b9",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2b4a2636-73dc-438f-a219-6be59e2b95b6",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "52f472c9-ccf4-4f16-af35-d93a091f1b2a",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "4376e4c2-672c-47e9-a5e4-47a604f3c490",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "ef2ad0e2-ea9b-4cb6-af08-8c5b383f739f",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "A sample report\nsays someone saw a\nlamp but could not\ntell whether",
                      "it was steady or\ndouble. The\nreceiver must not\ninvent a clear\ncode",
                      "from an unclear\nsighting. A\nwritten received\ncard at the post\ncan",
                      "resolve the doubt;\nif it cannot, the\nreceiver must\ncheck in person.",
                      "The clerk\nremembers how much\ntrouble began when\nsilence was\ntreated",
                      "as agreement. An\nuncertain flash\ndeserves the same\nhonest caution."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "7f7e073a-07a5-4a0a-a6e1-9f8c79b07145",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
